<title>HONG KONG: Great Wall interim profit rises 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Great Wall interim profit rises 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   4.1	vs 3.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0	vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs 18.21 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    38.57    vs 32.04</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,551.74 vs 1,525.22</p>
<p>    Company name		 Great Wall Electronic</p>
<p>				     International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  February 26 to March 3</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   March 17</p>
<p>NOTE - Great Wall Electronic manufactures consumer electronic products.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
